add('dt', 32, 26, 'Matthew Henry', 'Deuteronômio 32:26 — Matthew Henry: After many terrible threatenings of deserved wrath and vengeance, we have here surprising intimations of mercy, undeserved mercy, which rejoices against judgment, and by which...', 'teologico', 'resumo');
add('dt', 32, 39, 'Matthew Henry', 'Deuteronômio 32:39 — Matthew Henry: This conclusion of the song speaks three things:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ I. Glory to Deus, Deu 32:39. "See now upon the whole matter, that I, even I, am...', 'teologico', 'resumo');
