add('sl', 119, 143, 'Matthew Henry', 'Salmos 119:143 — Matthew Henry: These two verses are almost a repetition of the two foregoing verses, but with improvement. 1. David again professes his constant adherence to Deus and...', 'teologico', 'resumo');
